import struct
for name in ['assets/pixel.webp','assets/pixel.tiff','assets/pixel.xwd','assets/pixel.qoi']:
 data=open(name,'rb').read(); print(name, len(data))
 if name.endswith('webp'):
   print(data[:200])
   off=12
   while off < len(data):
     typ=data[off:off+4]; sz=struct.unpack('<I', data[off+4:off+8])[0]; print(typ, sz, data[off+8:off+8+min(sz,32)])
     off+=8+sz+(sz&1)
 if name.endswith('tiff'):
   # parse IFD
   endian='<' if data[:2]==b'II' else '>'
   off=struct.unpack(endian+'I', data[4:8])[0]
   n=struct.unpack(endian+'H', data[off:off+2])[0]; print("ifd entries",n)
   for i in range(n):
     e=data[off+2+i*12:off+2+(i+1)*12]
     tag,typ,cnt,val=struct.unpack(endian+'HHII', e); print(tag,typ,cnt,val, e[8:])
 if name.endswith('xwd'):
   vals=struct.unpack('>25I', data[:100]); print(vals)
PY"}

